#🌱PlantCulture— Django E-Commerce

A garden-themed e-commerce site with login-protected products, cart, and order placement.

## Features
- ✅ Login / Register (Products tab only visible after login)
- ✅ Product listing with category filter and search
- ✅ Product detail page
- ✅ Add to Cart / update quantity / remove items
- ✅ Checkout with shipping address
- ✅ Order placement and My Orders history
- ✅ Django Admin to manage products

## Setup

### 1. Install dependencies

pip install 


### 2. Run migrations

python manage.py makemigrations
python manage.py migrate


#This creates:
- Superuser: `admin` / `admin123`

- 12 sample products across 4 categories

### 4. Run the server

python manage.py runserver
    
Open http://127.0.0.1:8000

## Admin
Go to http://127.0.0.1:8000/admin to add/edit products, categories, and orders.

## Adding product images
IDemo user: `admin` / `admin123`n Django admin, open any product and upload an image via the "Image" field.

